1175
00:01:56,817 --> 00:01:58,177
You can ask me anytime.

1176
00:01:58,307 --> 00:01:59,527
Thanks!

1177
00:02:04,727 --> 00:02:06,287
Oh, I nearly forgot.

1178
00:02:08,067 --> 00:02:10,147
These are for you, if you'd like.

1179
00:02:11,337 --> 00:02:13,177
Did you make all these yourself?

1180
00:02:13,177 --> 00:02:15,147
I'd love some!

1181
00:02:18,027 --> 00:02:19,497
It's delicious!

1182
00:02:19,497 --> 00:02:20,917
Thank you.

1183
00:02:21,467 --> 00:02:22,547
<i>Since then,</i>

1184
00:02:22,547 --> 00:02:24,867
<i>Maria-chan and I have grown a lot closer</i>

1185
00:02:25,447 --> 00:02:29,027
<i>All the others have been captivated by her sweets, too.</i>

1186
00:02:32,587 --> 00:02:33,457
Here you go.

1187
00:02:33,457 --> 00:02:36,117
President! Thank you so much!

1188
00:02:40,627 --> 00:02:42,517
Delicious.

1189
00:02:42,667 --> 00:02:46,347
The student council president 
makes great tea, doesn't he?

1190
00:02:46,347 --> 00:02:47,237
Yes.

1191
00:02:47,237 --> 00:02:50,237
I'd never guess that he was 
the son of nobility.

1192
00:02:50,527 --> 00:02:52,977
He beat Nicol to the top of his grade

1193
00:02:52,977 --> 00:02:55,367
in both academic marks and magic ability.

1194
00:02:55,807 --> 00:02:59,537
I heard his fan club even 
has more members than Nicol's.

1195
00:02:57,117 --> 00:02:58,247


1196
00:02:57,117 --> 00:02:59,537


1197
00:03:01,247 --> 00:03:02,567
<i>Man, he's fast!</i>

1198
00:03:02,567 --> 00:03:06,127
<i>He only had a side role in the game, 
but he's actually a beast!</i>

1199
00:03:08,147 --> 00:03:10,097
Thank you for the tea again today.

1200
00:03:10,487 --> 00:03:12,017
You're welcome.

1201
00:03:12,017 --> 00:03:14,807
You know, the tea you make...

1202
00:03:16,217 --> 00:03:18,257
has a very gentle flavor.

1203
00:03:24,847 --> 00:03:26,367
<i>But the truth is,</i>

1204
00:03:26,367 --> 00:03:28,837
<i>when I'm outside the student council office,</i>

1205
00:03:28,837 --> 00:03:33,107
<i>I don't see much of the president or Maria-chan.</i>

1206
00:03:33,107 --> 00:03:35,777
And we want to be better friends with Maria!

1207
00:03:35,777 --> 00:03:41,207
It seems like she keeps her distance 
from us outside the student council office.

1208
00:03:43,757 --> 00:03:45,437
Oh, Campbell-sa—

1209
00:03:50,277 --> 00:03:52,347
Well, you can't blame her!

1210
00:03:52,577 --> 00:03:57,227
All these people, including Catarina, 
are among the highest nobility in the nation.

1211
00:03:57,227 --> 00:04:00,547
It's probably hard for her 
to just strike up a conversation.

1212
00:04:00,807 --> 00:04:03,457
In the game, the conquerable characters

1213
00:04:03,457 --> 00:04:08,297
approach the heroine more and more 
as their affection levels rise.

1214
00:04:08,297 --> 00:04:12,947
But no one's approaching 
Maria-chan right now.

1215
00:04:12,947 --> 00:04:17,267
In fact, Catarina appear to have 
the highest affection toward Maria right now.

1216
00:04:17,267 --> 00:04:21,997
She always seems to be alone 
when not in the student council office.

1217
00:04:22,197 --> 00:04:26,947
It seems like Maria-san is being 
bullied by the other noble kids...

1218
00:04:26,947 --> 00:04:28,817
That's a huge problem!

1219
00:04:26,957 --> 00:04:30,447
Emergency<i>!</i>

1220
00:04:26,957 --> 00:04:30,447
Huge problem<i>!</i>

1221
00:04:28,817 --> 00:04:30,457
Unbelievable!

1222
00:04:30,457 --> 00:04:34,917
Catarina witnessed such a scene once,

1223
00:04:34,917 --> 00:04:38,497
but that was only the tip of the iceberg.

1224
00:04:38,497 --> 00:04:39,977
We have to do something!

1225
00:04:39,977 --> 00:04:41,427
No objections!

1226
00:04:49,427 --> 00:04:50,787
Sister, did you need something?

1227
00:04:50,787 --> 00:04:52,667
There's something I want to discuss!

1228
00:04:52,667 --> 00:04:54,487
H-Huh?

1229
00:04:55,547 --> 00:04:57,367
Oh... So that's it.

1230
00:04:57,607 --> 00:05:02,197
What can I do to help protect Campbell-san?

1231
00:05:04,197 --> 00:05:08,797
Perhaps... we could stay 
with her as much as possible?

1232
00:05:09,107 --> 00:05:10,257
With her?

1233
00:05:10,447 --> 00:05:11,657
Yes.

1234
00:05:11,657 --> 00:05:14,147
If she's with you and me,

1235
00:05:14,147 --> 00:05:18,337
they won't find it easy to bully her, 
considering statuses and all.

1236
00:05:18,527 --> 00:05:19,917
<i>That's it!</i>

1237
00:05:20,447 --> 00:05:25,427
<i>I'll make a move myself to spend more time 
with her outside the student council!</i>

1238
00:05:25,697 --> 00:05:27,397
Thanks, Keith!

1239
00:05:35,667 --> 00:05:37,737
All right! It's lunch time!

1240
00:05:37,737 --> 00:05:40,107
I'll invite Maria-chan to eat with me.

1241
00:05:40,497 --> 00:05:45,947
She always ate lunch out here 
by herself in the game, if I recall...

1242
00:05:46,117 --> 00:05:47,747
You're just a commoner!

1243
00:05:48,367 --> 00:05:52,107
Don't get full of yourself just 
because you joined the student council.

1244
00:05:52,107 --> 00:05:55,567
I truly pity the student council 
members who feel they have

1245
00:05:55,567 --> 00:05:57,587
no choice but to pay attention to you.

1246
00:05:57,587 --> 00:06:00,157
I bet your score on the achievement test

1247
00:06:00,157 --> 00:06:03,387
was biased because your light magic is so special.

1248
00:06:05,137 --> 00:06:07,257
Don't get cocky!

1249
00:06:09,477 --> 00:06:11,717
Come forth, Earth Bump!

1250
00:06:09,477 --> 00:06:11,717
Come forth, Earth Bump!

1251
00:06:11,657 --> 00:06:13,657


1252
00:06:17,267 --> 00:06:18,507
<i>Did you see that?!</i>

1253
00:06:18,507 --> 00:06:20,907
<i>That's the power of my Earth Bump,</i>

1254
00:06:20,907 --> 00:06:22,737
<i>The fruit of my years of training!</i>

1255
00:06:24,527 --> 00:06:27,477
Enough with your false accusations!

1256
00:06:27,477 --> 00:06:29,947
This school grades students 
based purely on merit.

1257
00:06:29,947 --> 00:06:32,047
There is no bias.

1258
00:06:32,177 --> 00:06:35,817
Maria-chan is always working her very hardest,

1259
00:06:35,817 --> 00:06:37,497
and her test showed the results of that effort!

1260
00:06:37,747 --> 00:06:40,607
Besides, the student council members and I

1261
00:06:40,607 --> 00:06:44,427
don't hang out with her 
just because of her light magic!

1262
00:06:44,427 --> 00:06:45,747
We do it because

1263
00:06:45,747 --> 00:06:49,547
she's a hard worker who puts her all 
into everything, and we like her.

1264
00:06:50,047 --> 00:06:53,717
If you girls keep this up...

1265
00:06:54,757 --> 00:06:56,677
doom will befall you.

1266
00:06:56,677 --> 00:07:00,317
<i>Just like it befalls the villainess 
Catarina Claes in the game!</i>

1267
00:07:00,317 --> 00:07:02,427
We're sorry!

1268
00:07:03,497 --> 00:07:05,727
They're all such fools.

1269
00:07:05,727 --> 00:07:07,587
Maria-chan, are you oka—

1270
00:07:10,417 --> 00:07:11,547
Maria-chan?!

1271
00:07:11,547 --> 00:07:14,307
I know that was scary... 
but it's all right now!

1272
00:07:14,307 --> 00:07:17,587
Um, Claes-sama... My name...

1273
00:07:17,587 --> 00:07:18,607
Your name?

1274
00:07:18,607 --> 00:07:20,567
Oh! I'm sorry!

1275
00:07:20,567 --> 00:07:23,387
I just started calling you 
"Maria-chan" as if we're best friends...

1276
00:07:23,387 --> 00:07:26,357
No, I don't mind that at all.

1277
00:07:26,357 --> 00:07:29,227
In fact, instead of "Maria-chan"... well...

1278
00:07:30,487 --> 00:07:33,057
Please just call me "Maria"!

1279
00:07:36,827 --> 00:07:39,157
Thanks, Maria!

1280
00:07:41,727 --> 00:07:44,027
If you'll allow it,

1281
00:07:44,337 --> 00:07:50,597
may I also call you "Catarina-sama," 
like the student council members do?

1282
00:07:50,597 --> 00:07:53,257
Of course! Call me whatever you like!

1283
00:07:53,257 --> 00:07:55,997
You and I are friends now, after all.

1284
00:08:01,897 --> 00:08:04,417
Wait, what's wrong?!

1285
00:08:07,407 --> 00:08:12,197
I never thought they'd go so far 
as to use magic against her.

1286
00:08:13,127 --> 00:08:13,977
Oh!

1287
00:08:14,217 --> 00:08:16,647
Come to think of it, 
the Catarina in the game...

1288
00:08:17,397 --> 00:08:19,607
...did the same thing!

1289
00:08:20,097 --> 00:08:21,637
One day, during lunch break,

1290
00:08:21,637 --> 00:08:24,497
Catarina and the girls she used 
as her minions surrounded Maria,

1291
00:08:24,497 --> 00:08:28,147
and one of them tried 
to hurt Maria with fire magic!

1292
00:08:28,347 --> 00:08:32,917
Then Keith produced an earth doll 
with this magic and saved her.

1293
00:08:34,597 --> 00:08:38,417
And then Keith gently embraced her.

1294
00:08:38,627 --> 00:08:40,647
You know, Keith in that part...

1295
00:08:40,647 --> 00:08:44,897
He's normally a playboy, 
so he's not really used to acting like that.

1296
00:08:44,897 --> 00:08:48,127
That gap is just so hot!

1297
00:08:48,137 --> 00:08:50,947
Emergency<i>!</i>

1298
00:08:48,137 --> 00:08:50,947
Huge problem<i>!</i>

1299
00:08:48,137 --> 00:08:50,947
Danger<i>!</i>

1300
00:08:48,207 --> 00:08:50,977
So did we steal another major event from her?!

1301
00:08:50,947 --> 00:08:50,967


1302
00:08:51,137 --> 00:08:52,747
First it was Geordo,

1303
00:08:52,747 --> 00:08:56,307
and now we've taken a crucial 
relationship event from Keith...

1304
00:08:56,647 --> 00:08:59,247
But maybe that's for the better.

1305
00:08:59,247 --> 00:09:03,467
I mean, if those two work out, 
Catarina could be doomed.

1306
00:09:03,467 --> 00:09:06,047
In other words, since the event with Geordo,

1307
00:09:06,047 --> 00:09:08,577
we continue to unintentionally maintain 
distance from our own doom flag.

1308
00:09:08,577 --> 00:09:10,257
Am I amazing or what?!

1309
00:09:10,257 --> 00:09:12,027
Amazing!

1310
00:09:10,257 --> 00:09:12,027
Super amazing!

