1335
00:09:21,607 --> 00:09:26,047
<i>That said, I still need to keep 
tabs on the progress of Maria-chan's</i>

1336
00:09:26,047 --> 00:09:28,087
<i>relationships with the conquerable characters.</i>

1337
00:09:28,477 --> 00:09:31,967
<i>Which makes this the perfect time 
for girl talk about relationships!</i>

1338
00:09:32,447 --> 00:09:35,437
So, Maria, who do you like?

1339
00:09:35,437 --> 00:09:36,247
Huh?

1340
00:09:37,517 --> 00:09:41,867
I... am deeply fond of you, Catarina-sama.

1341
00:09:41,867 --> 00:09:42,227
Huh?

1342
00:09:42,227 --> 00:09:44,847
Me, too! More than anyone else!

1343
00:09:44,847 --> 00:09:47,697
Me, too! I feel the same, Catarina-sama!

1344
00:09:47,867 --> 00:09:49,987
Thanks, everyone...

1345
00:09:49,987 --> 00:09:54,157
<i>That does make me happy, but that's 
not the kind of "like" I meant...</i>

1346
00:09:54,547 --> 00:09:57,377
You're all welcome to 
have some of these if you'd like.

1347
00:09:58,187 --> 00:09:59,727
I'd love to!

1348
00:10:01,437 --> 00:10:02,817
Delicious!

1349
00:10:03,527 --> 00:10:07,317
<i>Maria-chan's as cute as can be again today.</i>

